# Keep the build context to what the image actually needs: app/, server/ and
# the root workspace manifests. Everything else is either build output the
# Dockerfile regenerates, or large and irrelevant (the desktop shell, the site).
**/node_modules
**/dist
server/web
**/.turbo
**/.vite
**/*.log

.git
.claude
.soundbox
server/.run-data
server/.scratch-data

src-tauri
site/*
!site/package.json
hoa-animatic
docs
scripts

.env
.env.*
